        },
        {
          "text": " Wonti sunini barimnaani qonqooni koola isii shawesa d'awa galaanatifi dibbeesa duula guddatifi qonqo Waaqa gudda nati fakaate. Wonti sunini barifte teteete jennaani koola dachaafate, ",
